# NOTE: api/ is deliberately NOT ignored here.
# Vercel falls back to .gitignore when no .vercelignore exists, and the ignore
# rules are applied to the post-build filesystem. Ignoring api/ therefore
# stripped the built api/index.mjs out of Git-connected deployments, leaving
# every route 404ing. The artifact stays in .gitignore so it is never committed.
